        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biocides, for paper production, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biocides, for paper production, unspecified, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of biocides, unspecified. Very large uncertainty of the process data, as only a mixture of different materials is included.;
UUID: 1b23c244-1495-31ec-aeed-cf83c28a80ad
Mixture of two oxidizing agents (chlorine dioxide, hydrogen peroxide) and two highly toxic organics (dithiocarbamate, cyanazin). Only input of mentioned substances is taken into account.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (raw materials represented by typical examples). Data are used as European average data.
Technology: equal split to four different substances without any further inputs/outputs
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b23c244-1495-31ec-aeed-cf83c28a80ad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
